#   (OrcaRouter), api.perplexity.ai (Perplexity), api.router.tetrate.ai (Tetrate Agent Router Service),
#   api.routerplex.com (RouterPlex), api.routstr.com (Routstr), api.sakana.ai (Sakana AI), api.saygm.com (SayGM),
